# res://tests/gss/m3_spec_registry.gd
## Material Design 3 specification coverage registry (m3.material.io, incl. M3 Expressive 2025).
##
## Every entry is one M3 spec element that MUST be implemented by the library and verified by GSS
## (Godot Scene Snapshot) artifacts produced by the res://tests/gss/test_gss_*.gd suites.
##
## Fields:
##   id        Stable spec id referenced by suites via M3GSSHarness.cover().
##   category  m3.material.io category (Foundations, Actions, Communication, Containment, Navigation,
##             Selection, Text inputs).
##   name      Human readable spec element name.
##   spec      Canonical m3.material.io URL.
##   scripts   Library scripts that implement the element (must exist on disk).
##   variants  Spec variants/configurations the element snapshots must include.
##   requires  Evidence kinds that must be recorded by passing GSS tests:
##               "element"     -> static GSS snapshot (.gss.json/.gss.html/.png)
##               "interaction" -> live GSS recording of user input changing state (.gss.live.*)
##               "animation"   -> live GSS recording proving a tween/motion animated over frames
